{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light &amp; Claw</strong> is a top-down 3D action RPG with a rare twist \u2014 the protagonist is a <i>transforming healer</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a White Mage who supports allies with powerful healing and protective magic, but in moments of crisis can transform into a mighty white tiger warrior, wielding heavy weapons to crush enemies head-on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory hinges on your ability to adapt: master a variety of healing and support spells, time your heals precisely, and unleash your transformation at just the right moment to turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore intricate labyrinths, face formidable foes, and discover a combat system where healing is as vital as striking, and where the line between mage and warrior is yours to command.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806610?t=1756989725","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806610/2b9f4e450bc40b00a76c4ee72e8b14df5d292c75/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756989725","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806610/61201e30206ec3c3addf6d40be0e5fe57548f269/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756989725","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806610/61201e30206ec3c3addf6d40be0e5fe57548f269/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756989725","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light &amp; Claw</strong> is a top-down 3D action RPG with a rare twist \u2014 the protagonist is a <i>transforming healer</i>.</p><p class=\"